  "name": "tatoeba_mt_parquet",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for DigitalLearningGmbH/tatoeba_mt_parquet\n\t\n\nThis is a mirror of Helsinki-NLP/tatoeba_mt, converted to parquet for compatibility with newer huggingface requirements.\nOriginal dataset card follows.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nThe Tatoeba Translation Challenge is a multilingual data set of machine translation benchmarks derived from user-contributed translations collected by Tatoeba.org and provided as parallel corpus from OPUS. This dataset includes test and development\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/DigitalLearningGmbH/tatoeba_mt_parquet.",
